{"id":"1a145b88092ce22e","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-weak2random.md","title":"弱 2 随机性","display":"df-weak2random — 弱 2 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-weak2random"],"display":"df-weak2random — 弱 2 随机性","label":"43-df-weak2random","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-genmltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2，印刷178，PDF198；§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.11–Corollary 10.5.12，印刷236–237，PDF256–257","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-weak2random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak2random — 弱 2 随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-weak2random"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"324aa8987ee8eac3\" href=\"?note=324aa8987ee8eac3\" title=\"43-df-genmltest\">43-df-genmltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2，印刷178，PDF198；§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.11–Corollary 10.5.12，印刷236–237，PDF256–257"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenMLTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenMLTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"324aa8987ee8eac3\" href=\"?note=324aa8987ee8eac3\" title=\"43-df-genmltest\">43-df-genmltest</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\">\\(\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{GenMLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_n U_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{GenMLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_n U_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等价于避开所有有效Π₂⁰零类。不要与相对于0′的Kurtz随机性混同。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2，印刷178，PDF198；§10.5.1 Theorem 10.5.11–Corollary 10.5.12，印刷236–237，PDF256–257。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genmltest","status":"resolved","id":"324aa8987ee8eac3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genmltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genmltest","status":"resolved","id":"324aa8987ee8eac3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{GenMLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-genmltest]]，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenMLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{GenMLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_n U_n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-weak2random]] — 弱 2 随机性"},{"id":"716a4678ad674a84","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-2random]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]。"},{"id":"2f46290baa611feb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-weak2random]]、[[43-df-diffrandom]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"0e25902f9c93ca41","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(X)$，见 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$、$\\mathrm{Weak2Random}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]；有效开集与测度见 [[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"2e434343f51a33e9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-weak2random]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-genmltest]]。"},{"id":"f733a11305f2610a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$；相关谓词见 [[43-df-weak2random]]、[[43-df-pi01class]]。"}],"outgoing":["324aa8987ee8eac3"]}